---
import '../styles/global.css';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About Us - Rehman Veterinary Clinic</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn more about Rehman Veterinary Clinic and Dr. Saif Ur Rehman, providing premium mobile vet services and 24/7 care in Lahore." />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans selection:bg-emerald-200 selection:text-emerald-900">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">About Us</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
      <p class="mb-4">Welcome to <strong>Rehman Veterinary Clinic</strong>. Founded by Dr. Saif Ur Rehman (DVM), our clinic is dedicated to providing high-quality, compassionate care to the pets of Lahore. We understand that visiting a clinic can sometimes be a stressful experience for both pets and their owners. That's why we bring hospital-grade veterinary care directly to your doorstep with our specialized mobile vet house calls.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Our mission is simple: To provide accessible, stress-free, and top-tier veterinary care. We believe that every pet deserves exceptional medical attention without the anxiety of a waiting room. We offer transparent pricing, reliable service, and 24/7 emergency video consultations to ensure your pet is always protected.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Meet Dr. Saif Ur Rehman</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Dr. Saif is a fully licensed veterinarian with over 9 years of clinical experience in Lahore. Having performed thousands of home visits, vaccinations, and emergency triage interventions, Dr. Saif is an expert in both preventive care and urgent medical stabilization. From routine deworming to critical late-night trauma, Dr. Saif handles every case with unmatched dedication.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Why Choose Us?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4">
        <li><strong>In-Person Clinic:</strong> Visit us at our physical location in Gulberg 2, Lahore from 12 PM to 9 PM.</li>
        <li><strong>Mobile Convenience:</strong> We cover all major sectors of Lahore including DHA, Gulberg, and Bahria Town for home visits.</li>
        <li><strong>24/7 Availability:</strong> Pet emergencies don't have office hours. We offer round-the-clock video triage.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparent Care:</strong> No hidden fees. We believe in ethical veterinary medicine.</li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-8 mb-4">Thank you for trusting us with your furry family members.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
